# Zura AI — Environment Variables
# ================================
# No .env file is required for normal development.
# Copy this file to .env only if you need to override defaults.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Vite Dev Server URL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Automatically set by Vite when you run `npm run dev`.
# You should NOT set this manually — Vite injects it at startup
# and Electron uses it to load the renderer in development mode.
# VITE_DEV_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:5173

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# API Keys
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# API keys are NOT configured via environment variables.
# They are entered through the in-app Settings UI and stored
# locally on your machine via Electron secure storage
# (OS keychain when available, encrypted JSON fallback).
#
# Supported providers:
#   - OpenRouter
#   - Perplexity
#   - Groq
#   - Alibaba Cloud (DashScope)
#   - Tavily (web search)
#
# See docs/development.md for more details.
